C\"></span><span>She wants to divide the work on the project fairly.</span></div></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":3}],"audio_fallbacks":["https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/achieve-ielts-academic-listening-test-1-3.mp3"],"order_index":3},{"id":"en-achieve-ielts-t1-l-p4","title":"Part 4","part_number":4,"passage_text":"","audio_url":"https://ielts-listening-audio.engnovatemedia.com/3226807-achieve-ielts-academic-listening-test-1-4.mp3","question_groups":[{"id":"en-achieve-ielts-t1-l-g4-0","type":"source_html","ieltsQuestionType":"matching_features","instructions":"","sourceHeading":"Questions 31-35","sourceHtml":"<div class=\"source-question-section-content\"><p>Of which US news source is each of the following statements true?</p><p>Write the correct letter, A, B or C.</p></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"matching-dnd-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"> • It is more popular at the weekend than during the week.<span class=\"options-drop-zone dnd-zone\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">31</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-achieve-ielts-t1-l-q31\" data-luma-kind=\"drop\"></span></span></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"> • It has affected the popularity of local radio.<span class=\"options-drop-zone dnd-zone\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">32</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-achieve-ielts-t1-l-q32\" data-luma-kind=\"drop\"></span></span></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"> • It has recently been able to expand internationally.<span class=\"options-drop-zone dnd-zone\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">33</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-achieve-ielts-t1-l-q33\" data-luma-kind=\"drop\"></span></span></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"> • It is offering more varied reporting than previously.<span class=\"options-drop-zone dnd-zone\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">34</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-achieve-ielts-t1-l-q34\" data-luma-kind=\"drop\"></span></span></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"> • It has suffered from government intervention.<span class=\"options-drop-zone dnd-zone\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">35</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-achieve-ielts-t1-l-q35\" data-luma-kind=\"drop\"></span></span></div></div><div class=\"options-dnd-panel dnd-panel dnd-panel--matching\"><div class=\"dnd-panel-instruction\">Drag and drop an option to fill in each blank.</div><div class=\"dnd-cards-container\"><div class=\"dnd-card\" data-luma-drag=\"A\"><span class=\"dnd-label\">A.</span><span class=\"dnd-text\">television</span></div><div class=\"dnd-card\" data-luma-drag=\"B\"><span class=\"dnd-label\">B.</span><span class=\"dnd-text\">internet</span></div><div class=\"dnd-card\" data-luma-drag=\"C\"><span class=\"dnd-label\">C.</span><span class=\"dnd-text\">the press</span></div></div></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":5},{"id":"en-achieve-ielts-t1-l-g4-1","type":"source_html","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","instructions":"","sourceHeading":"Questions 36-40","sourceHtml":"<div class=\"source-question-section-content\"><div class=\"source-section-content-wrapper\"><p>Complete the summary below.</p><p>Write NO MORE THAN TWO WORDS for each answer.</p><p><strong>Advertising and Newspapers</strong></p><p>In the USA, newspapers are being increasingly inventive about the way they attract advertisers and their <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">36</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-achieve-ielts-t1-l-q36\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> now exceeds that of other industries. Advertising has increased because of a good relationship with the <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">37</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-achieve-ielts-t1-l-q37\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> sector. In addition, newspapers now run more adverts which include <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">38</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-achieve-ielts-t1-l-q38\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span>. These have been found to raise readership of the papers and create more sales for the <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">39</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-achieve-ielts-t1-l-q39\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span>. There are also an increasing number of more expensive <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">40</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-achieve-ielts-t1-l-q40\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> adverts.</p></div></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":5}],"audio_fallbacks":["https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/achieve-ielts-academic-listening-test-1-4.mp3"],"order_index":4}],"questions":[{"id":"en-achieve-ielts-t1-l-q1","part_id":"en-achieve-ielts-t1-l-p1","group_id":"en-achieve-ielts-t1-l-g1-0","question_type":"source_text","ieltsQuestionType":"table_completion","question_text":"","correct_answer":"weekend trips","correct_answer_variants":["weekend trips"],"answerCount":1,"sourceNumbers":[1],"sourceInputName":"ielts_listening_answer_3222963_1","order_index":1,"points":1},{"id":"en-achieve-ielts-t1-l-q2","part_id":"en-achieve-ielts-t1-l-p1","group_id":"en-achieve-ielts-t1-l-g1-0","question_type":"source_text","ieltsQuestionType":"table_completion","question_text":"","correct_answer":"competitions","correct_answer_variants":["competitions"],"answerCount":1,"sourceNumbers":[2],"sourceInputName":"ielts_listening_answer_3222963_2","order_index":2,"points":1},{"id":"en-achieve-ielts-t1-l-q3","part_id":"en-achieve-ielts-t1-l-p1","group_id":"en-achieve-ielts-t1-l-g1-0","question_type":"source_t